bring _foreign.tung
bring data/one.tung
bring web/request.tung
bring web/response.tung

show-ilk request
show request
show request-method
show request-target
show request-headers
show request-body

show-ilk response
show response
show response-status
show response-headers
show response-body
show respond
show ok
show not-found
show with-header

## serve http/1.1 over ipv4 with one request per connection.
show deed web {
  integer serve (request → response ! e): 𝟙 ! e, text fail
}
